    LLM: "Keep track of the 22 trumps. If you are the declarer, try to clear the defenders' trumps as early as possible.\n\nThe 'Fox' play: Intentionally keeping a low card (singleton) to bait defenders into revealing their high court cards.\n\nDeclarer should keep a long suit to pull trumps, while defenders should try to 'sandwich' the declarer so they play first into a new suit.",
